=2 Walkthrough
* Travel to {z:Norg} and speak with {n:Ryoma} to receive the quest.
** If you just completed {q:20 in Pirate Years|20 in Pirate Years|20 in Pirate Years} you will need to zone and re-enter {z:Norg} for {n:Ryoma} to begin this quest
* Talk to {n:Ensetsu} in {z:Port Bastok} at (I-5), who tells you to speak with {n:Leodarion}.
* Head to {z:Rabao} and talk to {n:Leodarion} at (F-8) on the west side of the lake near the windmill.
* {n:Leodarion} will request an {p:Oak Pole}, which is purchasable via {p:Sparks} from a {p:Records of Eminence} NPC:
** {n:Rolandienne} in {z:Southern San d'Oria} (G-10)
** {n:Isakoth} in {z:Bastok Markets} (E-11)
** {n:Fhelm Jobeizat} in {z:Windurst Woods} (J-10)
** {p:Eternal Flame} in {z:Western Adoulin} (H-11)
*** Costs 156 {p:Sparks}. Can be found under "**Equ. Lv. 40 - 50.**", on Page 2.
* After trading it to him, speak to {n:Leodarion} again on the next Vana'diel day. You will receive the {@k}{k:Seance staff} with instructions to travel to {z:Mhaura}.
* Once in {z:Mhaura}, take the ferry to {z:Selbina} so that you will be traveling at nighttime.
** Suitable ferry departure times for this quest leave {z:Mhaura} at 16:00 and 0:00.
* The NM {m:Enagakure} will spawn on the main deck.
** On the ferry departing at 0:00, it will already be on the deck and will disappear at 4:00.
** On the ferry departing at 16:00, you must wait for night time at 20:00 for it to appear.
** Make sure you have unloaded FastCS, as they will cause you to be booted straight to Selbina if zoning into the Mhaura-Selbina Ferry at night.
* Once you have defeated {m:Enagakure}, make sure you have at least one inventory slot free and wait until the ferry docks in Selbina.
* You will receive a cutscene, {i:Ninja Hakama|Ninja Hakama|14226}, and the quest will be complete.

